doesn’t seem to work.
With the Web Animations API
Dan Wilson explored some of this in Future Use: CSS Motion Paths. You have access to all this same stuff in JavaScript through the Web Animations API. For example, say you’ve defined a offset-path
in CSS, you can still control the animation through JavaScript:
